      <a href="/demo/redcap-roofing/terms-of-use/">Terms</a> &middot;
      <a href="/demo/redcap-roofing/accessibility/">Accessibility</a> &middot;
      <a href="/demo/redcap-roofing/sitemap/">Sitemap</a> &middot;
      <a href="https://pikespeakwebdesigns.com/" class="demo-footer-pp" rel="noopener">Site by Pikes Peak Web Designs</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

